--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Ultralytics (YOLO / YOLOE, BoT-SORT, ByteTrack)
  https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics
  Licensed under AGPL-3.0. Smart Qora links Ultralytics at runtime for detection
  and tracking; keeping this project under AGPL-3.0 satisfies that license.

Line-crossing counter approach
  Adapted from the "YOLO11 line crossing counter" example by NitinCVOrbit
  (https://github.com/NitinCVOrbit). The counting geometry in
  backend/app/vision/counter.py is an independent reimplementation.

