  Licensed CC BY 4.0. Attribution is required for any model trained on it.
  Cite as:
    Helary, L., Okoye, K. N., Kolodziejczyk, M., Schewe, J., Philip, L.,
    Nicolas, E., & Lebreton, A. (2024). Drone videos and their annotations of
